    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Gameplay Video</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out this awesome gameplay video by Zahait to <strong>see what the rookie pilots can expect</strong>:<br>youtube . com / watch?v=bcf4zjVVgQ8</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>A true test to your agility and maneuvering skills in this arcade style, physics based, 2D space sim. Deliver packages between planets avoiding various obstacles, upgrade your ship and progress through the galaxy uncovering new worlds and gameplay modifications.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797690/extras/8fca7f36e3f92fb41fdd57a2dfbbb4ca.webp?t=1743636099\" width=616 height=48 /></span><br>Transport packages from one planet to another - a seemingly simple task, but what if the package contains a living, moving animal or food that needs to be delivered quickly enough? Each package modifies the gameplay slightly, forcing you to adapt to it.<br><br>For a job well done you will get a reward, and for a bad one your reputation on the planet will drop. You don't want to explain yourself to your boss when that happens.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797690/extras/f19a0c92259e7a0102d06292d4b2230b.webp?t=1743636099\" width=616 height=48 /></span><br>Discover new planets and various threats. The further into the universe you go, the more dangers await you. Space debris, meteorites, interference, gravitational fields, signal loss.... Do you think you can handle them all?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797690/extras/c9333199214253e52ccb272cfa4bbb9c.webp?t=1743636099\" width=616 height=48 /></span><br>Besides flying from planet to planet, special, challenging levels await you to test if you can handle specific package types. Prove yourself and expand the portfolio of package types you can deliver!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797690/extras/7129fa32f5ef0346e50fa2b3b4168baa.webp?t=1743636099\" width=616 height=48 /></span><br>Not enough challenge? No problem! There are letters scattered throughout the levels. Are you clever enough to find your way to them? Are you brave enough to snatch those placed in peculiarly dangerous areas?<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797690/extras/dca5f82ddbbe3724089ac4a4a7d45664.webp?t=1743636099\" width=616 height=48 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797690/extras/8776b867f60e2a9ea5ff1000b4530f25.avif?t=1743636099\" width=512 height=102 /></span><br>With work comes pay, and that pay is best spent on improving your precious ship. Select upgrades to best meet the dangers you will encounter on your way.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>A true test to your agility and maneuvering skills in this arcade style, physics based, 2D space sim. Deliver packages between planets avoiding various obstacles, upgrade your ship and progress through the galaxy uncovering new worlds and gameplay modifications.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797690/extras/8fca7f36e3f92fb41fdd57a2dfbbb4ca.webp?t=1743636099\" width=616 height=48 /></span><br>Transport packages from one planet to another - a seemingly simple task, but what if the package contains a living, moving animal or food that needs to be delivered quickly enough? Each package modifies the gameplay slightly, forcing you to adapt to it.<br><br>For a job well done you will get a reward, and for a bad one your reputation on the planet will drop. You don't want to explain yourself to your boss when that happens.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797690/extras/f19a0c92259e7a0102d06292d4b2230b.webp?t=1743636099\" width=616 height=48 /></span><br>Discover new planets and various threats. The further into the universe you go, the more dangers await you. Space debris, meteorites, interference, gravitational fields, signal loss.... Do you think you can handle them all?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797690/extras/c9333199214253e52ccb272cfa4bbb9c.webp?t=1743636099\" width=616 height=48 /></span><br>Besides flying from planet to planet, special, challenging levels await you to test if you can handle specific package types. Prove yourself and expand the portfolio of package types you can deliver!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797690/extras/7129fa32f5ef0346e50fa2b3b4168baa.webp?t=1743636099\" width=616 height=48 /></span><br>Not enough challenge? No problem! There are letters scattered throughout the levels. Are you clever enough to find your way to them? Are you brave enough to snatch those placed in peculiarly dangerous areas?<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797690/extras/dca5f82ddbbe3724089ac4a4a7d45664.webp?t=1743636099\" width=616 height=48 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797690/extras/8776b867f60e2a9ea5ff1000b4530f25.avif?t=1743636099\" width=512 height=102 /></span><br>With work comes pay, and that pay is best spent on improving your precious ship. Select upgrades to best meet the dangers you will encounter on your way.",
